          ],
          "text": "According to Diamond Alternative Energy, LLC (Petitioners), petitioners argue that when the government denies a party the ability to compete in a marketplace and the party sues to lift that restriction, there is redressability because the party is asking for the thing to be taken away that's causing its injury."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
