          ],
          "text": "Fuel producers contend they have standing because invalidating the regulations would remove a regulatory impediment to the sale of their products."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Court",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b5d7daa366245deda468df4b5f19d0cc00a08aeeada5d83c308abad031571c2a",
